      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have never had the problem, that a tracker is detected as a controller and when vrchat messes up my controllers i just restart the one, that is detected wrongly. I dont understand why you'd need to restart the game to reassign the trackers... when i turn them off for charging etc. And on later again, they're almost always at the right spot afterwards.. and if not - a simple device restart helps.\n\ni dont have a wireless hmd, so maybe thats whats causing problems, but even if the hmd crashes it should just work again after a restart.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
