      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is more of an issue that only the HTC team can fix. I honestly think that this issue may be with your headset more than anything, VRChat doesnt mess with tracking or controller recognition beyond using it for the game. If one of your trackers is doing that, it is an issue with the tracker itself.",
      "viewerReactions": null
