      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: It's only with using a wireless HMD, because if this one disconnects, it will disconnect the vive wands as well, and vrchat will take two trackers as wands and the wands are trackers after reconnect. It is based on Steams Device ID and can only be fixed by using static device names. I've build my own unity game where I fixed this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
