      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: Have you set your trackers to \"Disabled\" in the tracker management window? Valve made a change a while ago to make it easier to use trackers as controllers but it has the side effect of confusing VRChat. Setting them to \"Disabled\" makes them revert to the old way which should prevent them from being treated as controllers, counter-intuitively they still track when \"Disabled\".",
      "viewerReactions": null
